card.statement:
$\K_q(\bar x,\bar y)^{S_n}$ is generated as a skew field over $\K$ by the following set of $2n$ elements:

\[\{t_1,\ldots,t_n\}\cup\{e_1,\ldots,e_n\}\]

where

\begin{equation}
e_d:=\sum_{1\le i_1<\cdots <i_d\le n} x_{i_1}\cdots x_{i_d},\quad d\in\iv{0}{n}
\end{equation}

is the degree $d$ elementary symmetric polynomial in $x_1,\ldots,x_n$.
